WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,180 --> 00:00:04,180
Nie Xiaoyu, Class A

2
00:00:04,180 --> 00:00:08,160
A shocking score of 27 points

3
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,360
It turns out there will still be an announcement if you are eliminated.

4
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:19,420
It's not time to make substitutions yet

5
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:21,100
What are you doing out here if you don't want to sleep? You can't sleep?

6
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:23,100
Someone in Class A is out, huh?

7
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,300
But it has nothing to do with us

8
00:00:25,540 --> 00:00:26,900
I didn't sleep well last night

9
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,300
There are no plank beds today

10
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:38,380
Oops, I’m blind. Teacher Zhao didn’t sleep in the middle of the night.

11
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:42,680
What are you still doing here?

12
00:00:42,680 --> 00:00:44,280
This is not the thought of going back

13
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:46,980
I'm going to be picked on by those old guys again.

14
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:50,740
Can't you fall asleep because you have to write a report? Mr. Fu?

15
00:00:50,740 --> 00:00:53,060
You should dim the light bar a little bit.

16
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:56,600
If you know you're in trouble, don't actively seek trouble.

17
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,100
Just take a rest as soon as possible

18
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:00,400
We're going to stay here for seven days and get to the back

19
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:02,650
The more likely something will happen

20
00:01:02,650 --> 00:01:03,650
Got it

21
00:01:03,650 --> 00:01:04,850
Teacher Fu finished draining the water

22
00:01:04,850 --> 00:01:06,050
Go back to bed early too
